language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

capability AuthoritativeMachineState.
functionality ConsumeTargetRecord.
functionality DecodeP1000Frames.
functionality AdvanceP1000Protocol.
functionality CalibrateMeasurement.
functionality ReduceMachineState.
functionality ValidateMachineCommand.
functionality InjectSemanticOperatorInput.
