MachineService cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/services/machine-service/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
MachineService provides AuthoritativeMachineState.
MachineService owns ConsumeTargetRecord.
ConsumeTargetRecord realizes AuthoritativeMachineState.
ConsumeTargetRecord specifies "Choose configured Target endpoint; preserve session/delivery/P1000 sequence and exact byte provenance.".
MachineService owns DecodeP1000Frames.
DecodeP1000Frames realizes AuthoritativeMachineState.
DecodeP1000Frames specifies "Length-driven, capture-backed framing/checksum; payload FF is not an unconditional separator.".
MachineService owns AdvanceP1000Protocol.
AdvanceP1000Protocol realizes AuthoritativeMachineState.
AdvanceP1000Protocol specifies "Evidence-backed boot/runtime/control state machines; selective ACK decisions are distinct from delivery commits.".
MachineService owns CalibrateMeasurement.
CalibrateMeasurement realizes AuthoritativeMachineState.
CalibrateMeasurement specifies "Apply active calibration revision; publish calibrated/raw-only/unknown and absolute/working coordinates with evidence references.".
MachineService owns ReduceMachineState.
ReduceMachineState realizes AuthoritativeMachineState.
ReduceMachineState specifies "Single-owner authoritative machine/stem/head/saw/operator state and ordered source events; no forestry economics.".
MachineService owns ValidateMachineCommand.
ValidateMachineCommand realizes AuthoritativeMachineState.
ValidateMachineCommand specifies "Bind peer identity to connection; revalidate scoped overlapping grants, runtime capabilities, generations and request applicability.".
MachineService owns InjectSemanticOperatorInput.
InjectSemanticOperatorInput realizes AuthoritativeMachineState.
InjectSemanticOperatorInput specifies "Normalize explicit operator input with semantic-injection provenance; fabricate no P1000 wire bytes.".
MachineService owns HandleMachineStop.
HandleMachineStop realizes AuthoritativeMachineState.
HandleMachineStop specifies "Handle GlobalStop without ordinary control grant for valid clients; prioritize stop, invalidate queued normal epochs and preserve diagnostic collection.".
MachineService owns PublishMachineBaseline.
PublishMachineBaseline realizes AuthoritativeMachineState.
PublishMachineBaseline specifies "Serve independent subscribers and coherent snapshots/resume, catalogs, health, results and source/evidence lineage.".
